{
  "version": 18,
  "description": "WorkLoom IM 基座能力同步范围声明——base-sync 引擎的唯一事实源。文件型公共能力按 include/exclude 受控分发；三端组件/视觉语言通过与 ui-v* 同版的 CNB Release @workloom/ui tarball 下发，三端应用壳/导航/布局/状态/API 接线通过同一稳定标签和逐文件指纹升级 PR 下发。行业属性与演示能力永不同步。requiredRootAssets 无视行业代码的 pathPrefix，始终安装并校验在 Git 仓库根目录。修改本文件即修改同步边界，需基座 owner 评审。",
  "registryCapabilities": [
    {
      "package": "@workloom/ui",
      "source": "packages/ui/**",
      "consumers": [
        "apps/web",
        "apps/webb",
        "apps/webc"
      ],
      "distribution": "stable-github-release-upgrade-pr",
      "consumerGate": "scripts/verify-ui-consumer.mjs",
      "migration": "two-phase-required",
      "comment": "第一阶段先补齐三个真实生产客户端与产品身份配置，第二阶段再锁定同标签 CNB Release tarball 并运行消费门禁；缺少 apps/webb 等客户端时必须报告迁移未完成，禁止按三端合规处理。"
    }
  ],
  "clientFoundationCapability": {
    "source": "apps/web/** + apps/webb/** + apps/webc/**",
    "configuration": "sync/base-capabilities.json#clientFoundation",
    "installer": "sync/client-foundation.mjs",
    "stateFile": ".workloom-client-foundation.json",
    "distribution": "stable-tag-upgrade-pr",
    "conflictPolicy": "previous-source-sha256-fail-close",
    "industryExtensionPaths": [
      "apps/*/src/extensions/**",
      "apps/*/src/projections/**",
      "apps/*/src/config/industry/**",
      "apps/*/src/theme/industry/**",
      "apps/*/public/industry/**"
    ],
    "comment": "这些路径仍显式排除普通 base-sync，避免双通道覆盖。新行业用 adopt.sh --new-industry 从 latest stable 一次生成三端；存量仓只经 ui-upgrade-pr 波次 PR 更新。"
  },
  "uiGovernanceCapability": {
    "installer": "sync/install-ui-governance.mjs",
    "stateFile": ".workloom-ui-governance.json",
    "dependency": "npm:typescript@5.9.3",
    "yamlDependency": "npm:yaml@2.9.0",
    "managedFiles": [
      "scripts/verify-ui-consumer.mjs",
      "scripts/ui-governance-rules.mjs"
    ],
    "distribution": "stable-upgrade-pr-only",
    "comment": "消费 verifier、AST 规则和固定解析器是同一个稳定治理单元；不得再由普通 base-sync 提前覆盖，否则治理 state 会与实际脚本失配，并阻断后续稳定升级。"
  },
  "protectedChildAssets": {
    "files": [
      "electron-builder.yml",
      "product.manifest.json"
    ],
    "identityFields": [
      "appId",
      "productName",
      "demoWorkspaceSlug",
      "demoMemberNo",
      "ports",
      "publish"
    ],
    "comment": "桌面应用标识、产品名、端口和发布身份属于部署实例资产；base-sync 不得整文件覆盖。新行业应由 product.manifest.json 显式配置，存量仓先完成身份迁移再接收稳定基座升级。"
  },
  "desktopReleaseCapability": {
    "consumerWorkflow": ".github/workflows/build-desktop.yml",
    "finalizer": "scripts/desktop-release-finalizer.mjs",
    "publisherTemplate": "sync/downstream-desktop-publisher-job.yml",
    "buildRuntime": {
      "nodeVersion": "24.19.0",
      "npmVersion": "11.17.0",
      "nodeSource": "scripts/release-assets.json",
      "npmSource": ".workloom-runtime-deps/metadata.json",
      "setupNodePolicy": "exact-version-only"
    },
    "platformCandidates": [
      "macos",
      "windows"
    ],
    "installerDiscovery": [
      "*-mac-arm64.dmg",
      "*-mac-x64.dmg",
      "*-win-x64.exe"
    ],
    "evidenceAssets": [
      "WorkLoom-SHA512SUMS.txt",
      "WorkLoom-release-manifest.json"
    ],
    "distribution": "base-sync-script-plus-reviewed-workflow-upgrade-pr",
    "publisherInvariant": "platform jobs are read-only; one publisher seals a draft, verifies five assets, then promotes Latest",
    "comment": "桌面正式发布封口器从各仓 electron-builder.yml 已生成的真实 artifactName 发现三平台安装包，不维护产品名称表。行业身份由 github.repository、稳定 tag、精确提交和签名模式注入；平台 job 只能上传同一 run 的候选，唯一发布 job 才能写 Release。setup-node 必须使用 buildRuntime.nodeVersion 精确值，禁止 24 等浮动主版本，否则 Node 随附 npm 会与 runtime lock 漂移。"
  },
